one little resting place for your badge:
```css
.tile {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
}
```
Give the tile some height if you want visible space above and below the badge.

catch the parsing error:
```python
try:
    data = json.loads(text)
except json.JSONDecodeError:
    data = {}
```
Here `text` is your input string. Invalid JSON gets an empty dictionary.
